          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The notion of
            %strong
              Postnikov tower in an
              = succeed "-category" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
